Subject: ca-certificates: distrust the compromised emSign ECC Root CA - G3

CVE-2026-91403. Remove G3 from the shared certificate staging directory;
both the hashed trust store and the concatenated bundle must omit it.

Applies to: OpenWrt 25.12.6

--- a/package/system/ca-certificates/Makefile
+++ b/package/system/ca-certificates/Makefile
@@ -11 +11 @@
-PKG_RELEASE:=1
+PKG_RELEASE:=2
@@ -49,0 +50 @@
+	rm $(PKG_INSTALL_DIR)/usr/share/ca-certificates/mozilla/emSign_ECC_Root_CA_-_G3.crt
